*  Passing sibling for ev_code_end_terminates: one ingredient removed —
*  the fragment ends by transferring BACK into the main program (the
*  manual's p.133 idiom) instead of at :(END).  Green in BOTH modes.
        C = CODE("  OUTPUT = 'in fragment' :(DONE)")
        OUTPUT = 'before'                       :<C>
DONE    OUTPUT = 'after'
END
